    "fullContentHtml":  "\n\u003ch1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\"\u003eBPSC Exam Calendar 2026\u003c/h1\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\"\u003ePost Date: \u003ctime class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-02-03T14:02:15+05:30\"\u003eFebruary 3, 2026\u003c/time\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cspan class=\"custom-post-time\"\u003e2:02 pm\u003c/span\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\"text-align: justify;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://bpsc.bihar.gov.in/\"\u003eBihar Public Service Commission BPSC\u003c/a\u003e,\u003c/strong\u003e As per the latest official update, the \u003cstrong\u003eBihar Public Service Commission (BPSC)\u003c/strong\u003e has released the \u003cstrong\u003eExam Calendar for 2025–2026.\u003c/strong\u003e It includes the schedule for various recruitment examinations such as Assistant Education Development Officer (AEDO), Assistant Town Planner (ATP) Special School Teacher (Classes 1-5 \u0026amp; Classes 6-8) Assistant Engineer (Civil / Mechanical / Electrical) Block Cooperative Officer Block Minority Welfare Officer Revenue Officer \u0026amp; Equivalent Labor Superintendent Senior Deputy Collector / Sub-Divisional Officer.\u0026nbsp;Candidates planning to appear for these \u003cstrong\u003eexams\u003c/strong\u003e can now check their exam dates and download their \u003cstrong\u003eadmit cards.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\"\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\u0026amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    \u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \n\u003cdiv class=\"social-buttons\"\u003e\u003c!-- WhatsApp Button --\u003e \u003ca class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e WhatsApp \u003c/a\u003e \u003c!-- Telegram Button --\u003e \u003ca class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e Telegram \u003c/a\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\"\u003eBPSC Exam Calendar 2026\u003c/h2\u003e\n\n\n\u003ch3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\"\u003eBPSC Exam Information 2026 : Short Details\u003c/h3\u003e\n\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/bpsc-exam-calendar-2026/\"\u003eSarkariResult.com.cm\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eImportant Dates\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: #ffff00;\"\u003eExam Date : January 2026 To June 2026\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eAdmit Card Date : \u003cstrong\u003eBefore Exam\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eResult Date : \u003cstrong\u003eWill Be Updated Here Soon.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eApplication Fee\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNot Available.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\"\u003e\n\u003ch5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\"\u003eAge Limit Details\u003c/h5\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWill Be Updated Here Soon.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\"\u003e\n\n\u003ch5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTotal Post\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\"\u003eNot Available\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\u003cdiv style=\"text-align:center;\"\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\u0026amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    \u003c/a\u003e\n    \u003c/div\u003e\n    \n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\"\u003e\n\u003ch6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\"\u003eBPSC Exam Information 2025 : Recruitment Details\u003c/h6\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eExam Name\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eExam Conducted By\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eBPSC Various Posts New Exam Calendar 2026\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eBihar Public Service Commission\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff;\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt; background-color: #000080;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;How To Check \u0026amp; Download The BPSC Exam Calendar 2026\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"\" data-start=\"130\" data-end=\"216\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"\" data-start=\"133\" data-end=\"216\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"133\" data-end=\"168\"\u003eVisit the Official BPSC Website\u003c/strong\u003e:\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"169\" data-end=\"172\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eGo to bpsc.gov.in.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"\" data-start=\"218\" data-end=\"341\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"\" data-start=\"221\" data-end=\"341\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"221\" data-end=\"263\"\u003eGo to the ‘Examinations’ Section\u003c/strong\u003e:\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"264\" data-end=\"267\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eOn the homepage, hover over the \u003cstrong data-start=\"302\" data-end=\"320\"\u003e“Examinations”\u003c/strong\u003e tab in the top menu.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"\" data-start=\"343\" data-end=\"422\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"\" data-start=\"346\" data-end=\"422\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"346\" data-end=\"367\"\u003eSelect ‘Calendar’\u003c/strong\u003e:\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"368\" data-end=\"371\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eFrom the dropdown menu, click on \u003cstrong data-start=\"407\" data-end=\"421\"\u003e“Calendar”\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"\" data-start=\"424\" data-end=\"552\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"\" data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"552\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"462\"\u003eAccess the Annual Calendar 2026\u003c/strong\u003e:\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"463\" data-end=\"466\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eOn the Calendar page, find and click on the link titled \u003cstrong data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"551\"\u003e“Annual Calendar 2026”\u003c/strong\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"\" data-start=\"554\" data-end=\"675\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"\" data-start=\"557\" data-end=\"675\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-start=\"557\" data-end=\"577\"\u003eDownload the PDF\u003c/strong\u003e:\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr data-start=\"578\" data-end=\"581\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"\u003eThe BPSC Exam Calendar 2026 PDF will open. You can download or print it for your reference.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003c/tr\u003e\n\u003c/tbody\u003e\n\u003c/table\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\u003ch6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-cbf2939c gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSOME USEFUL IMPORTANT LINKS\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h6\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003c!-- SarkariResult --\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"gb-container gb-container-761d9c16\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4b7d6947 importaint_links gb-headline-text\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ctable style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\"\u003e\n\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCheck Revised Exam Calendar\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h5\u003e\n\u003c/td\u003e\n\u003ctd style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center; background-color: #fff091;\"\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\u003ca href=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Examination-Calendar-02.0